      "output": "8",
      "explanation": "There are 8 valid tuples:\n(2,6,3,4) , (2,6,4,3) , (6,2,3,4) , (6,2,4,3)\n(3,4,2,6) , (4,3,2,6) , (3,4,6,2) , (4,3,6,2)"
    },
